Probe 2 — per-query granularity (REQ-77 Success Criterion 2)
One Evaluator.evaluate() call per query, looped over 5 distinct real
PrimeKG val queries (val split selected via qa_dataset.get_subset('val'),
see pick_query.py — an earlier draft ignored <split> entirely, fixed
during this probe, see raw/setuptools-fix.log sibling note in Task 3
commit). No batch-shaped call was needed — evaluate() is already
single-query-shaped (one pred_dict + one answer_ids tensor); the
per-query CLI contract needed no workaround.

